Changelog:

# SPECIAL THANKS TO BETA TESTERS:
- tasxatzial
- avc1657

# OVERVIEW
- Small patch to fix bugs and some visual tweaks.

# General changes:
- Remade cirrus clouds, now they look twisted and more natural.
- Even reduced artifacts on DoF and Bloom.
- Remade fog, now it looks more smooth.
- Near fog now works as ground fog, improving scene depth.
- Rework on how fog colors are calculated.
- Revamped emissives, giving it a better look.
- Sea lanten, glowstone, torches and lanterns now glow when handheld. (Require emissive materials turned on.)
- Selective TAA is now implemented, reducing ghost in entities. (Inherited from MakeUp)
- Small changes on sun glow.
- Vanilla Sun/moon now cuts when it is below horizon.
- Reduced color banding in sky.
- Small changes on how tonemap treats colors.

# Bugfixes:
- Fixed some black/colorful pixels appearing randomly (mainly on plants and seagrass.)
- Fixed some issues with AO in Distant Horizons chuncks.
- Fixed a bug that made sign texts to disappear while using labPBR on 26.3.

Version code: ELT514

